  "text": "In October 2023, we turned on ourselves. Twenty-three of us reached for the \"motion to vacate,\" and the \"speaker of the house\" — a phrase forty-nine of us pronounced by month's end — became a vacancy. For weeks we filled it with no one. Then the record shows the language of return: twenty-three of us said \"back to work,\" twenty-two said \"forward to working,\" twenty-one said \"look forward to working.\" On the twenty-fifth we converged. Twenty-one of us named \"speaker mike johnson,\" twenty-two said \"mike johnson r-la,\" twenty-one called him \"the 56th speaker.\" The instrument reads a house that removed its head and, weeks later, agreed on who would hold it. The peak of our agreement arrived the day the vacancy closed.",
